{
  "project": {
    "name": "Bottle-to-Bottle Coupler",
    "slug": "bottle-coupler",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Joins two PCO-1881 bottles neck-to-neck. Screw a bottle into each end for a sealed transfer/storage joint, a 'tornado tube' vortex demonstrator, or thread onto one bottle and open into a wide catch funnel for pouring. Every end is a real PCO-1881 female helical thread (27.43 mm thread major diameter, 2.7 mm pitch) — the same neck used by the bottle-thread, bird-feeder, faircap-filter and pet-dispenser cartridges.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Une dos botellas PCO-1881 cuello con cuello. Enrosca una botella en cada extremo para una junta de trasvase/almacenamiento sellada, un demostrador de vórtice 'tornado tube', o enrosca en una sola botella y ábrela en un embudo ancho para verter. Cada extremo es una rosca helicoidal hembra PCO-1881 real (27.43 mm de diámetro mayor de rosca, paso 2.7 mm) — el mismo cuello usado por los cartuchos bottle-thread, bird-feeder, faircap-filter y pet-dispenser.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/bottle-coupler.webp",
